{"completed": true, "response": "他还说不清自己到底在怕什么，就先顾着眼下，和那个人慢慢相处。两个人以后会怎样，他想留到以后再看；眼下喜欢对方，他只想好好亲近对方，享受这份喜欢。这样一想，他慢慢就能放下心，和那个人亲近起来了。\n\n他很喜欢这种感觉。他心里有一份温柔，想对那个人好时，就能自然地对那个人好；对方有没有把这份心意放在心上，他暂时也不急着弄清楚。那个人对他很重要，他却依然能过得轻松自在。有时他甚至觉得，自己比以前更自在了。原来把一个人放进心里，也可以让人觉得安心；他能认真地在乎对方，照着自己的心意关心对方，把心思放在眼前的相处上。\n\n这份快乐确实让他心里踏实了些。他慢慢放下了对自己这份喜欢的戒心，甚至有点喜欢自己这样温和、想得开的样子。他想，要是两个人能一直这样自然地亲近，他就只管好好关心对方，心里轻松，少些追问和计较，那该多好。那时他觉得，这样已经够好了。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e626ff2a-e6b6-497e-952b-82d44d60a8f0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002130098030Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.531, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:22:38.645929+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a87df2e842275a39d36558a2158cdabde5c0bb89f3698f6b6ea560ff0addd7eb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002130098030Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "6f345629303d737feb163b1c2633dbe25ea19cdde26721f01ae119dc92087006"}}}
